## 1. Executive Summary

This repository documents the end-to-end installation, configuration, and cryptographic pairing of a **Wazuh SIEM/XDR** platform in a dedicated security lab environment. The deployment covers the central management server on Ubuntu Linux and the enrollment of a Windows client endpoint for real-time security event telemetry, log collection, and threat detection. Each technical step is directly mapped to industry security frameworks, including **ISO/IEC 27001:2022**, **NIST SP 800-53**, and **CIS Controls v8**.

