5. Next Steps & Recommendations
Active Response Rules: Configure automated firewall blocks on Manager for brute-force attempts.

File Integrity Monitoring (FIM): Add critical Windows system paths (C:\Windows\System32\drivers\etc\hosts) to ossec.conf.

Post-Deployment Hardening: Rotate default admin credential, enforce MFA on Dashboard, and backup PKI CA keys.

